      {
        "index": 2,
        "name": "Beginning Your Journey",
        "description": "MENU: “Feel like you’re getting the hang of my interface?”\nMENU: “Excellent! Now that you’re oriented, let's start exploring your surroundings. You can move around the world using my map screen. Do you remember where it is? Go ahead and open it now.”\nMENU: “There are two ways to move around in the world. You can move to an adjacent tile by clicking the red highlight on the map, or you can right click on any tile to show the harvest screen for that tile as well as fast traveling to it.”\nMENU: “Movement costs five stamina, which comes out of the stamina pool shown in the bottom left corner of my interface.” \nMENU: “You have one hundred stamina to start with and you recover one point of stamina every minute, so you’ll have to plan out your moves a bit so that you don’t tire yourself out too much.”\nMENU: “But go ahead and explore around for now. When you’re ready to continue, head south and you’ll see a big Torii on the edge of town.\nMENU: “Once you get there, I’ll give you a Spell Card.”",
