        "name": "Building a Reputation",
        "description": "MENU: “This one is a more personal request.”\nMENU: “I want to try and do some repairs on my systems and update my world data cache. If you can get me the raw materials, I should be able to jury-rig the parts I’ll need to do it.”\nMENU: “So can you please get me a few units of Scrap Metal?”\nMENU: “You should be able to find some in that anomalous junkyard beyond the torii gate.”\nMENU: “I know it’s a bit inconvenient, but please? I’d really appreciate it.”",
