        "name": "Having a Normal One",
        "description": "MENU: “That cache refresh definitely helped me out, the Kamigotchi World seems to have changed a lot since I was last online, but thanks to that upgrade I’m getting a feel for things again.”\nMENU: “So we’re gonna take things step by step, starting with the most basic, Normal parts of the world.”\nMENU: “That is to say, the Normal type room tiles.”\nMENU: “Zevana should have already told you about kami and room types, but to review…\nMENU: “Something with the Normal Type represents the essence of this realm in its purest form.”\nMENU: “That will make them a good place to begin our investigation I think.”\nMENU: “Collect three scavenges from normal type rooms and lets see what we can learn.”",
